         "rule_named": "difference of tabulated values"
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "Dividing by the change in time, \\( P'(8) \\approx \\frac{P(10) - P(7)}{10 - 7} = \\frac{65 - 28}{10 - 7} = \\frac{37}{3} \\).",
